                "Compatible WAVE files remain the default direct-writeback format. The ARC/SPC repacker does not automatically transcode or alter audio.\n\n"
                "The remaining missing component is a built-in audio modification editor. FFmpeg is installed now only as infrastructure for that future module; automatic transcoding will be used when such an editor is implemented. For now, use an AI-assisted programming workflow and external software such as Audacity. Users only need to decide which sounds to replace, how to adjust dB M, pitch, and playback speed, and how to make the 60 or more RE6 audio fragments easier to edit in batches.",
                "CODE X 现在已经具备完整的 SPC 往返编辑链路：\n\n"
