            "必需的解析 DDS/XML 缺失，未用原版替补，条目未进入 ARC",
            "The TXT recorded a writable DDS/XML result, but it was deleted, renamed, or moved. The original TEX/XFS is intentionally not auto-restored; edit or regenerate the parsed file, then run Conservative Batch Repack again.",
